    "chunk_text": "w;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2129$89 - 2019 cqks ui 28 jeks isl=rdod - 2019'06'28No. 2129/89 - FRIDAY JUNE 28, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A - PG 4574 \u2014112 (06/2019)\n\nMEDIATION BOARDS COMMISSION\n\nNotice Calling for Nominations for the Appointment of Mediators\n\nTHE Mediation Boards Commission, by virtue of the powers vested in it by Section 5(1) of The Mediation Boards Act,No.72 of 1988, invites nominations for the appointment of Chairman and Mediators in respect of the following Panels ofMediation Boards who are to vacate post in terms of sections 6 to 11 in Schedule 1 of the Mediation Boards Act.\n\nAdministrative DistrictMediation Board AreasDate of Vacation of Post\n\nGampaha01.Negombo2019.08.15\n\nKalutara01.Bandaragama2019.07.0102.Horana2019.07.0103.Mathugama2019.07.0104.Dodangoda2019.07.0105.Panadura2019.07.0106.Walallawita2019.09.3007.Millaniya2019.09.30\n\nKandy01.Pathadumbara2019.07.0102.Kundasale2019.07.0103.Hasalaka2019.09.15\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'06'28PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 28.06.20192A\n\nMathale01.Pallepola2019.07.0102.Raththota2019.09.29\n\nNuwaraeliya01.Kothmale2019.09.0102.Nuwaraeliya2019.09.15\n\nMatara01.Dikwella2019.07.15\n\nHambanthota01.Lunugamwehera2019.07.15\n\nTrincomalee01.Kuchchaveli2019.07.01\n\nPuttalam01.Puttalam2019.07.01\n\nAnuradhapura01.Nochchiyagama2019.07.01\n\nMoneragala01.Katharagama2019.07.01\n\nRathnapura01.Imbulpe2019.08.1502.Weligepola2019.09.15"
